      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "留在嘴里的甜味和窗外吹进来的冷空气\n格外柔和，让我觉得很舒服。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff949fc9f6a9edcd89fb5fb66aedc9e6fca8f2e4e8a4829a0f67df02d4d1bbc4",
